{"language":"en","values":[["/names/cn","洛桑"],["/names/en","Lorsan"],["/description_i18n/cn","一名自由灵动的辅助，能够用风魔法链接敌人并传递伤害。"],["/description_i18n/en","A free-spirited Support who transfers damage between enemies by linking them with wind magic."],["/unit_voice_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","哇哦，真热闹啊，需要配乐吗，诸位？"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/text_i18n/en","Now this'll be fun."],["/unit_voice_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","更大的舞台在等待着我！"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/text_i18n/en","An even greater stage awaits me!"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/text_i18n/cn","嘘，听吧，风暴的声音！"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/text_i18n/en","I hear a storm coming!"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/text_i18n/cn","抱歉，演出临时中止……"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/text_i18n/en","The show's over..."],["/unit_voice_lines/4/text_i18n/cn","噢？需要安可曲吗？"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/text_i18n/en","Do we need an encore?"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/text_i18n/cn","需要伴奏吗"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/text_i18n/en","Who needs company?"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","风是我的琴弦，我是风的伴唱。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/text_i18n/en","The wind is my instrument, and I change to its tune."],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","风会帮助你，把声音传达到更远的地方。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/text_i18n/en","The wind will help you send a message to the ends of the world."],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/text_i18n/cn","让我听听大家在聊什么。嗯？哦——！这是我能听到的事情吗？！"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/text_i18n/en","Hmmm, let's see what everyone's saying..."],["/affinity_gift_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","不知道为什么，会想到故乡……你从哪里搞来的？再多来几个！"],["/affinity_gift_lines/0/text_i18n/en","It reminds me of home... Where did you uncover this gem?"],["/affinity_gift_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","哇哦，这东西还真稀奇。谢啦！"],["/affinity_gift_lines/1/text_i18n/en","Wow, this is quite a find! Thanks!"],["/skins/0/name_i18n/cn","风语漫游者"],["/skins/0/name_i18n/en","Windweaver Protector"],["/skins/0/description_i18n/cn","吟唱一首小诗，让自由的风载着歌声传遍大陆。"],["/skins/0/description_i18n/en","Let the wind carry your song across the entire continent"],["/skins/1/name_i18n/cn","冬日新曲"],["/skins/1/name_i18n/en","Winter's Tune"],["/skins/1/description_i18n/cn","风敲响新年的钟声，迎接煦煦冬日。"],["/skins/1/description_i18n/en","The wind ushers in the gentle winter sun in the upcoming year."],["/skins/1/acquisition_i18n/cn","英雄皮肤限时礼包购买获得。"],["/skins/1/acquisition_i18n/en","Hero Skin Limited Bundle"],["/skins/1/quality_i18n/cn","精英"],["/skins/1/quality_i18n/en","Elite"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","真热闹啊！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/0/text_i18n/en","What a lively place!"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/1/text_i18n/cn","好像听到了不该听的东西……"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/1/text_i18n/en","Oops, I might've eavesdropped on something spicy..."],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/1/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","是和丛林不一样的味道！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/1/lines/0/text_i18n/en","It's a different flavor from the forest!"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/2/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","真热闹，我想唱首歌了"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/2/lines/0/text_i18n/en","This energy makes me want to sing!"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/3/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","一起去看烟火吧！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/3/lines/0/text_i18n/en","Let's watch the fireworks together!"],["/affinity_tales/0/text_i18n/cn","洛桑擅长音乐与诗文，创作了许多首以“一只兔子的冒险”为主题的诗歌。"],["/affinity_tales/0/text_i18n/en","Lorsan excels in music and poetry and has penned an entire collection of poems titled \"The Adventures of a Rabbit\"."],["/affinity_tales/1/text_i18n/cn","作为一名风语者，洛桑对极其细微的声音也很敏感。但这并没有影响到他优越的睡眠质量。"],["/affinity_tales/1/text_i18n/en","As a Windwhisperer, Lorsan can pick up the faintest sounds from miles away. However, this doesn't affect his ability to sleep through anything."],["/affinity_tales/2/text_i18n/cn","薄暮丛林四季如春，因此在初次抵达寒冷的白山公国时，洛桑不得不掏出一大笔钱购置保暖衣服。"],["/affinity_tales/2/text_i18n/en","Lorsan grew up in the Dark Forest where they enjoy eternal spring, so his first winter in Whiteridge hit hard. His wallet was crying after buying all that warm clothing."],["/affinity_tales/3/text_i18n/cn","就读于翡湖学院期间，洛桑常常凭借出众的弹跳能力躲到树上睡觉，令老师们头疼不已。"],["/affinity_tales/3/text_i18n/en","Lorsan once entered an impromptu poetry duel during a village celebration. While his rival recited solemn verses, Lorsan's rhymes were all about bunnies and mischief. To everyone's surprise, his playful tone won over the crowd."],["/affinity_tales/4/text_i18n/cn","洛桑不太受艾洛娜的喜欢。据布莱恩所说，是因为艾洛娜觉得他太过聒噪。"],["/affinity_tales/4/text_i18n/en","For some reason, Elona isn't exactly fond of Lorsan. According to Bryon, it's because she thinks he talks too much."],["/affinity_tales/5/text_i18n/cn","“洛桑这孩子哪都好，就是有时候没大没小的，还背着我偷偷叫我老爷子。呵呵，我可都听见了。”雅顿这样说。"],["/affinity_tales/5/text_i18n/en","\"Lorsan's a good kid,\" says Arden. \"But sometimes he gets too cheeky for his own good. He thinks calling me 'old man' behind my back is funny—though I hear every word. Ha!\""],["/affinity_tales/6/text_i18n/cn","洛桑至今仍然保持着“一天之内被达赫妮婆婆的伞杖连戳十六次”的记录，无人能打破。"],["/affinity_tales/6/text_i18n/en","Lorsan holds a title no one's managed to beat: being poked sixteen times in one day by Granny Dahnie's umbra staff. Why? You'll have to ask her."],["/affinity_tales/7/text_i18n/cn","洛桑发来的风讯总是格外冗长——布莱恩和雅顿都很赞同这一点，但洛桑坚称自己没有。"],["/affinity_tales/7/text_i18n/en","Lorsan's wind messages are always long-winded. Both Bryon and Arden swear it's true, but Lorsan insists he's just being thorough."],["/affinity_tales/8/text_i18n/cn","尽管洛桑时不时闯祸，但好在他嘴巴甜、认错态度良好，所以薄暮丛林里的长者们都很喜欢他。"],["/affinity_tales/8/text_i18n/en","Lorsan organized a \"bunny relay\" in the Dark Forest, convincing some actual rabbits to join in the fun. While the bunnies followed his lead (mostly), Lorsan got too caught up in hopping along with them and tripped into a stream."],["/affinity_tales/9/text_i18n/cn","只有在撒娇或是有求于莱卡的时候，洛桑才会叫她“姐姐”。"],["/affinity_tales/9/text_i18n/en","He once serenaded a field of flowers, convinced it would make them grow faster. He swears the sunflowers bowed toward him in thanks."],["/interaction_records/0/preview_i18n/cn","洛桑，你怎么会跑到这里来打工呢？"],["/interaction_records/0/preview_i18n/en","Lorsan, how did you end up working here?"],["/interaction_records/0/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep3/herohub_story/13411080.json"],["/interaction_records/0/locales/en","locales/en/ep3/herohub_story/13411080.json"],["/interaction_records/0/title_i18n/cn","漫漫 & 洛桑 & 满满"],["/interaction_records/0/title_i18n/en","Hammie & Lorsan & Chippy"],["/interaction_records/0/locations/0/name_i18n/cn","西白山领"],["/interaction_records/0/locations/0/name_i18n/en","West Whiteridge"],["/interaction_records/1/preview_i18n/cn","哎，我们的兔耳朵先生又忘了把刚晾晒好的温泉浴衣叠起来了！"],["/interaction_records/1/preview_i18n/en","*Sigh* That Wilder lad has forgotten to fold the bathrobes again!"],["/interaction_records/1/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep3/herohub_story/13411090.json"],["/interaction_records/1/locales/en","locales/en/ep3/herohub_story/13411090.json"],["/interaction_records/1/title_i18n/cn","格尔达 & 洛桑"],["/interaction_records/1/title_i18n/en","Gerda & Lorsan"],["/interaction_records/2/preview_i18n/cn","等打工结束我就准备离开白山，又得头疼接下来该去哪儿游历的问题了。"],["/interaction_records/2/preview_i18n/en","I'm planning to leave Whiteridge as soon as my job is done. It's time to think about where to go next."],["/interaction_records/2/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep3/herohub_story/13411100.json"],["/interaction_records/2/locales/en","locales/en/ep3/herohub_story/13411100.json"],["/interaction_records/2/title_i18n/cn","洛桑 & 漫漫"],["/interaction_records/2/title_i18n/en","Lorsan & Hammie"],["/interaction_records/3/preview_i18n/cn","洛桑，满满很好奇，你变成雪人的时候有什么感受？"],["/interaction_records/3/preview_i18n/en","Lorsan, Chippy's curious—what was it like being a snowman?"],["/interaction_records/3/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep3/herohub_story/13411120.json"],["/interaction_records/3/locales/en","locales/en/ep3/herohub_story/13411120.json"],["/interaction_records/3/title_i18n/cn","满满 & 洛桑 & 漫漫"],["/interaction_records/3/title_i18n/en","Chippy & Lorsan & Hammie"],["/interaction_records/3/locations/0/name_i18n/cn","西白山领"],["/interaction_records/3/locations/0/name_i18n/en","West Whiteridge"],["/interaction_records/4/preview_i18n/cn","这儿真是个好地方，要是再来点音乐就更好了。"],["/interaction_records/4/preview_i18n/en","Wow, this place is great! It'd be even better with some music!"],["/interaction_records/4/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415479.json"],["/interaction_records/4/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415479.json"],["/interaction_records/4/title_i18n/cn","洛桑 & 莱卡"],["/interaction_records/4/title_i18n/en","Lorsan & Lyca"],["/interaction_records/5/preview_i18n/cn","真热闹啊！"],["/interaction_records/5/preview_i18n/en","What a lively place!"],["/interaction_records/5/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415489.json"],["/interaction_records/5/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415489.json"],["/interaction_records/5/title_i18n/cn","洛桑"],["/interaction_records/5/title_i18n/en","Lorsan"],["/interaction_records/6/preview_i18n/cn","是和丛林不一样的味道！"],["/interaction_records/6/preview_i18n/en","It's a different flavor from the forest!"],["/interaction_records/6/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415490.json"],["/interaction_records/6/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415490.json"],["/interaction_records/6/title_i18n/cn","洛桑"],["/interaction_records/6/title_i18n/en","Lorsan"],["/interaction_records/7/preview_i18n/cn","春焰庆啊，真是个不错的节日……"],["/interaction_records/7/preview_i18n/en","Ahh, the Emberlight Festival is the best!"],["/interaction_records/7/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415510.json"],["/interaction_records/7/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415510.json"],["/interaction_records/7/title_i18n/cn","洛桑 & 达赫妮婆婆"],["/interaction_records/7/title_i18n/en","Lorsan & Granny Dahnie"],["/interaction_records/8/preview_i18n/cn","真热闹，我想唱首歌了"],["/interaction_records/8/preview_i18n/en","This energy makes me want to sing!"],["/interaction_records/8/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415609.json"],["/interaction_records/8/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415609.json"],["/interaction_records/8/title_i18n/cn","洛桑"],["/interaction_records/8/title_i18n/en","Lorsan"],["/interaction_records/9/preview_i18n/cn","一起去看烟火吧！"],["/interaction_records/9/preview_i18n/en","Let's watch the fireworks together!"],["/interaction_records/9/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415610.json"],["/interaction_records/9/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415610.json"],["/interaction_records/9/title_i18n/cn","洛桑"],["/interaction_records/9/title_i18n/en","Lorsan"],["/interaction_records/10/preview_i18n/cn","哇！你这个造型太适合“鬼影密室”了！"],["/interaction_records/10/preview_i18n/en","Wow! That look of yours is perfected for Ghostly Getaway!"],["/interaction_records/10/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415803.json"],["/interaction_records/10/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415803.json"],["/interaction_records/10/title_i18n/cn","洛桑 & 巴登（未完整）"],["/interaction_records/10/title_i18n/en","Lorsan & Baden (incomplete)"],["/interaction_records/11/preview_i18n/cn","布莱恩先生，我一直很好奇，你为什么总是戴着眼罩呢？"],["/interaction_records/11/preview_i18n/en","Mr. Bryon, just out of curiosity, may I ask why you always wear a blindfold?"],["/interaction_records/11/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn2/herohub_story/10412011.json"],["/interaction_records/11/locales/en","locales/en/mn2/herohub_story/10412011.json"],["/interaction_records/11/title_i18n/cn","漫漫 & 布莱恩 & 洛桑"],["/interaction_records/11/title_i18n/en","Hammie & Bryon & Lorsan"],["/interaction_records/11/locations/0/name_i18n/cn","薄暮丛林"],["/interaction_records/11/locations/0/name_i18n/en","Dark Forest"],["/interaction_records/12/preview_i18n/cn","好像有什么奇怪的声音，洛桑，你能听到吗？"],["/interaction_records/12/preview_i18n/en","Lorsan, do you hear that strange noise...?"],["/interaction_records/12/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn2/herohub_story/10412070.json"],["/interaction_records/12/locales/en","locales/en/mn2/herohub_story/10412070.json"],["/interaction_records/12/title_i18n/cn","莱卡 & 洛桑"],["/interaction_records/12/title_i18n/en","Lyca & Lorsan"],["/interaction_records/12/locations/0/name_i18n/cn","薄暮丛林"],["/interaction_records/12/locations/0/name_i18n/en","Dark Forest"],["/interaction_records/13/preview_i18n/cn","嘿，达米安，我离开丛林都三年了，你肯定做出来不少好东西吧？"],["/interaction_records/13/preview_i18n/en","Hey, Damian! I bet you've created a ton of cool stuff in the past three years while I was away."],["/interaction_records/13/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn2/herohub_story/10412090.json"],["/interaction_records/13/locales/en","locales/en/mn2/herohub_story/10412090.json"],["/interaction_records/13/title_i18n/cn","洛桑 & 达米安 & 达赫妮"],["/interaction_records/13/title_i18n/en","Lorsan & Damian & Dahnie"],["/interaction_records/13/locations/0/name_i18n/cn","薄暮丛林"],["/interaction_records/13/locations/0/name_i18n/en","Dark Forest"],["/interaction_records/14/preview_i18n/cn","莱卡，你今天准备的食物有点多吧？"],["/interaction_records/14/preview_i18n/en","Lyca, that's a lot of food you have prepared today."],["/interaction_records/14/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn2/herohub_story/10412100.json"],["/interaction_records/14/locales/en","locales/en/mn2/herohub_story/10412100.json"],["/interaction_records/14/title_i18n/cn","洛桑 & 莱卡"],["/interaction_records/14/title_i18n/en","Lorsan & Lyca"],["/interaction_records/15/preview_i18n/cn","满满一直很好奇一件事。"],["/interaction_records/15/preview_i18n/en","Chippy has been curious about something for a long time."],["/interaction_records/15/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn2/herohub_story/10412140.json"],["/interaction_records/15/locales/en","locales/en/mn2/herohub_story/10412140.json"],["/interaction_records/15/title_i18n/cn","满满 & 洛桑"],["/interaction_records/15/title_i18n/en","Chippy & Lorsan"],["/interaction_records/15/locations/0/name_i18n/cn","薄暮丛林"],["/interaction_records/15/locations/0/name_i18n/en","Dark Forest"],["/interaction_records/15/locations/1/name_i18n/cn","瓦度索山脉"],["/interaction_records/15/locations/1/name_i18n/en","Vaduso Mountains"],["/interaction_records/16/preview_i18n/cn","说起来，我还真怀念我上学的时候，最大的烦恼只是怎么学好功课而已。哪像现在……"],["/interaction_records/16/preview_i18n/en","Yeah, I really miss when I was in school. My biggest worry was my lessons, not like now..."],["/interaction_records/16/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn2/herohub_story/10413020.json"],["/interaction_records/16/locales/en","locales/en/mn2/herohub_story/10413020.json"],["/interaction_records/16/title_i18n/cn","洛桑 & 芙拉贝尔 & 莱卡"],["/interaction_records/16/title_i18n/en","Lorsan & Florabelle & Lyca"],["/interaction_records/16/locations/0/name_i18n/cn","瓦度索山脉"],["/interaction_records/16/locations/0/name_i18n/en","Vaduso Mountains"],["/interaction_records/17/preview_i18n/cn","来丛林后，满满一直在努力注意言辞……"],["/interaction_records/17/preview_i18n/en","Ever since coming to the forest, Chippy has been paying special attention not to say too much..."],["/interaction_records/17/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn2/herohub_story/10413040.json"],["/interaction_records/17/locales/en","locales/en/mn2/herohub_story/10413040.json"],["/interaction_records/17/title_i18n/cn","满满 & 洛桑"],["/interaction_records/17/title_i18n/en","Chippy & Lorsan"],["/interaction_records/17/locations/0/name_i18n/cn","瓦度索山脉"],["/interaction_records/17/locations/0/name_i18n/en","Vaduso Mountains"],["/interaction_records/18/preview_i18n/cn","与我共饮吧，在这美丽的村落；与我共饮吧，为这宁静的时光……"],["/interaction_records/18/preview_i18n/en","♪ ...In this beautiful village, drink with me. In this quiet time, drink with me... ♪"],["/interaction_records/18/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn2/herohub_story/10413070.json"],["/interaction_records/18/locales/en","locales/en/mn2/herohub_story/10413070.json"],["/interaction_records/18/title_i18n/cn","洛桑 & 布莱恩"],["/interaction_records/18/title_i18n/en","Lorsan & Bryon"],["/interaction_records/19/preview_i18n/cn","哎呀，麻烦事终于结束了。你们听，这一路东奔西走，连喝水的时间都没有，我嗓音都沙哑了……"],["/interaction_records/19/preview_i18n/en","Finally, I can take a break. We've been running around all this time, and I didn't even have the time to get a drink of water. I'm so parched..."],["/interaction_records/19/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn2/herohub_story/10413090.json"],["/interaction_records/19/locales/en","locales/en/mn2/herohub_story/10413090.json"],["/interaction_records/19/title_i18n/cn","洛桑 & 埃隆"],["/interaction_records/19/title_i18n/en","Lorsan & Eironn"],["/interaction_records/19/locations/0/name_i18n/cn","瓦度索山脉"],["/interaction_records/19/locations/0/name_i18n/en","Vaduso Mountains"],["/interaction_records/20/preview_i18n/cn","布莱恩，不要递给我那份芜菁豆子汤……"],["/interaction_records/20/preview_i18n/en","Don't hand me that turnip soup, Bryon..."],["/interaction_records/20/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn2/herohub_story/10413110.json"],["/interaction_records/20/locales/en","locales/en/mn2/herohub_story/10413110.json"],["/interaction_records/20/title_i18n/cn","洛桑 & 布莱恩"],["/interaction_records/20/title_i18n/en","Lorsan & Bryon"],["/interaction_records/21/preview_i18n/cn","洛桑，真羡慕你能在伊索米亚各地游历。自从当了老师，我就再也没离开过瓦度索。"],["/interaction_records/21/preview_i18n/en","Lorsan, I envy you for being able to travel throughout Esperia. Since I became a teacher, I've never left Vaduso."],["/interaction_records/21/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn2/herohub_story/10413130.json"],["/interaction_records/21/locales/en","locales/en/mn2/herohub_story/10413130.json"],["/interaction_records/21/title_i18n/cn","芙拉贝尔 & 洛桑"],["/interaction_records/21/title_i18n/en","Florabelle & Lorsan"],["/interaction_records/21/locations/0/name_i18n/cn","瓦度索山脉"],["/interaction_records/21/locations/0/name_i18n/en","Vaduso Mountains"]]}